Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.46,0:00:03.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（游马）糟了 糟了 糟了！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.58,0:00:06.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}在到达场地之前不赶紧攒生命值可不行！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.46,0:00:09.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（小鸟）真是的 你冷静一点啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.06,0:00:11.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（星光体）没错 这里
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.79,0:00:13.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}既找不到回复生命值的陷阱{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.66,0:00:15.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}也找不到魔法卡。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.79,0:00:18.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}事到如今 只能找个人打一场了！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.90,0:00:19.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}喂～！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.81,0:00:22.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}有没有人在啊～！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.73,0:00:24.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}所以叫你冷静点啊～！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.83,0:00:26.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}话虽这么说啊～！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.31,0:00:42.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}《德鲁瓦：托隆…
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.46,0:00:44.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}从前夜祭第一次见到他时起{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.01,0:00:47.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}恐惧就缠住我 挥之不去。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.68,0:00:50.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这个男人 一定会 轻而易举地
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.05,0:00:51.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}将重要的东西践踏摧毁》
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.31,0:00:55.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}《但是 我要阻止》
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.02,0:00:58.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}托隆 我要阻止你我不会让你去快斗那里。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.86,0:01:03.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哦～？你居然对快斗那么……
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.65,0:01:05.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}没错。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.61,0:01:09.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我爱着他。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.65,0:01:12.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}真是美好啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.68,0:01:16.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（心园先生）哎呀
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.05,0:01:18.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}选择丛林场地作为战场的{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.43,0:01:22.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}是原大会运营委员德罗瓦以及谜之少年 托隆！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.73,0:01:24.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}决赛轮的四个场地
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.75,0:01:26.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}各自发挥其特性{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.53,0:01:28.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}都设置了场地魔法！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.22,0:01:31.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那么 这个丛林场地里究竟会有什么……
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.61,0:01:33.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}怎……怎么回事 这是！？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.96,0:01:36.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}到底搞什么啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.94,0:01:37.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}明明正精彩呢！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.86,0:01:38.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}根本看不见啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.73,0:01:40.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}真是个大失误！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.05,0:01:41.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}非常抱歉！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.61,0:01:44.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}各位工作人员，赶紧进行修复！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.23,0:01:48.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}《呵呵呵……这场决斗，可不能
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.68,0:01:50.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}让客人们看到呢》
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.60,0:03:25.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（两人）决斗！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.82,0:03:29.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}啊哈！生命值8000！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.55,0:03:30.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}太不成熟了！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.85,0:03:34.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不管用什么手段我都要打倒你。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.12,0:03:36.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}就在这片丛林场地上。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.76,0:03:39.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这里发动的场地魔法是{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.98,0:03:40.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}在自己的回合
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.98,0:03:43.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}从手牌召唤、特殊召唤怪兽。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.78,0:03:45.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}或者没有盖放的话{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.35,0:03:46.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}就要受到1000点
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.85,0:03:47.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}伤害。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.74,0:03:52.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这样啊，你是明知道还来这里的。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.67,0:03:55.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}在我的过山车上设下陷阱{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.77,0:03:57.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}把我引到这片丛林里来的
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.11,0:03:58.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}就是你吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.47,0:03:59.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}干得漂亮嘛。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.34,0:04:04.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}先手归我了！我的回合，抽卡！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.28,0:04:10.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我发动魔法卡，乱蝶幻舞！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.30,0:04:14.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这张卡在场上存在场地魔法时{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.84,0:04:15.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}可以从手牌
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.51,0:04:17.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}将等级4以下的幻蝶刺客{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.37,0:04:19.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}摩芙与凤蝶特殊召唤！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.25,0:04:24.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}现身吧幻蝶刺客，摩芙，凤蝶！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.57,0:04:26.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}将等级4的幻蝶刺客
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.93,0:04:28.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}摩芙与凤蝶，叠放！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.96,0:04:32.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}用2只怪兽
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.02,0:04:33.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}构建叠放网络！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.63,0:04:35.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}超量召唤！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.26,0:04:40.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}现身吧，光子蝶刺客！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.39,0:04:44.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}一上来就超量！？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.26,0:04:50.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}再加上3张永续魔法{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}来好好招待你！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.20,0:04:53.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}首先是第1张，蝶之魅惑。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.51,0:04:55.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这片丛林场地
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.91,0:04:58.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}根据场地魔法 将怪兽覆盖{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.49,0:04:59.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}若不召唤
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.30,0:05:01.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}玩家将会受到大量伤害。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.67,0:05:03.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}啊 刚才听过了。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.89,0:05:05.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}但是 蝴蝶护符{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.87,0:05:08.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你召唤的攻击表示怪兽
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.09,0:05:09.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}在没有攻击的情况下{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.82,0:05:11.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}会被强制破坏。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.47,0:05:13.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那我就攻击给你看！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.33,0:05:14.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}没那么容易。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.76,0:05:16.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}第二张 刺客之门。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.60,0:05:19.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这张卡 在名为刺客的
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.56,0:05:21.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}怪兽以外的怪兽{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.29,0:05:23.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}进行攻击时 强制破坏！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.39,0:05:25.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那 我的怪兽就…。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.25,0:05:27.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}没错 你的怪兽
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.88,0:05:29.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}等待着的命运{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.26,0:05:31.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}无论如何 都是强制破坏。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.80,0:05:33.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}怎… 怎么会！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.62,0:05:34.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}还没完！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.97,0:05:35.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哎？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.09,0:05:38.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}第三张 死亡蝴蝶邀请。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.72,0:05:41.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}发动它 并且为了维持它{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.57,0:05:43.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}必须支付 ２０００生命值。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.27,0:05:49.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}但是 场上的怪兽被破坏时{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.77,0:05:51.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}会对控制它的玩家
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.54,0:05:53.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}造成１５００点伤害。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.25,0:05:55.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}也就是说 我
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.39,0:05:57.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}如果不召唤怪兽{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.17,0:05:58.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}就会受到伤害
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.73,0:06:00.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}就算召唤了 怪兽也会被破坏{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.75,0:06:01.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}而且 随着破坏
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.93,0:06:03.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我也会受到 大量伤害……
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.11,0:06:06.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}以２０００生命值为代价
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.58,0:06:07.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}换来１５００的伤害……
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.87,0:06:10.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}原来如此 就是为了这个
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.19,0:06:12.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你才把生命值攒到了８０００啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.54,0:06:15.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（抽卡）只要这个连招运转起来{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.31,0:06:16.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你将在３个回合内
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.31,0:06:17.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}被这片丛林吞噬。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.05,0:06:20.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}《快斗……
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.51,0:06:24.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我从那一天起就一直对你……》
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.51,0:06:33.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（心园先生）年轻的决斗者们。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.26,0:06:36.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}很痛苦吧很难受吧……
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.84,0:06:38.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}但是{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.51,0:06:40.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}正是从这份痛苦之中{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.43,0:06:41.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}肩负下一代重任的
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.67,0:06:44.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}精英决斗者将会诞生！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.98,0:06:47.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}陷阱发动！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.49,0:06:53.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（快斗）抽卡！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.40,0:06:59.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那 那是！？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.51,0:07:14.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}来吧！鬼神失控了！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.13,0:07:18.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}想活命的话就用决斗赢下来！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.36,0:07:28.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}抽卡！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.81,0:07:39.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}快斗……
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.35,0:07:41.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}抽卡！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.88,0:07:43.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我召唤破晓者！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.29,0:07:52.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}上吧！直接攻击！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.10,0:08:16.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（快斗）别依赖别人！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.73,0:08:20.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}依赖的瞬间 你就会失去自我。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.78,0:08:35.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}《那是… 快斗…。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.11,0:08:39.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}记得… 是快斗的弟弟…》
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.42,0:08:42.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哈鲁特… 你看 是蝴蝶哦
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.28,0:08:53.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}《多洛瓦：不依赖任何人你的强大…。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.07,0:08:56.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那是为了守护弟弟而存在的…。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.09,0:08:59.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}看到你的笑容 我这么想着。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.08,0:09:04.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}可是… 明明是笑容却看起来好悲伤…》
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.44,0:09:08.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我决定了。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.37,0:09:12.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}就像快斗守护哈鲁特那样我来守护快斗。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.74,0:09:15.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不依赖任何人。 一个人战斗。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.61,0:09:18.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}为了看到快斗的笑容。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.91,0:09:21.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那么 我就成为你们爱情的牺牲品…。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.40,0:09:25.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哦哦！ 我真是个小丑啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.50,0:09:31.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这里是？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.03,0:09:35.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}丛林…。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.77,0:09:37.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那是…！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.15,0:09:44.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那是…。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.33,0:09:46.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}多洛瓦！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.76,0:09:49.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}托隆！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.22,0:09:52.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}多洛瓦…。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.56,0:10:02.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马！　呐呐快看！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.06,0:10:06.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我　掉进了可怕的陷阱里了。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.35,0:10:07.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}陷阱！？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.21,0:10:11.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}多洛瓦的场地上有３张魔法卡？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.42,0:10:13.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这是…。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.66,0:10:14.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}原来如此。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.70,0:10:18.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}场地魔法和３张永续魔法 combo
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.34,0:10:20.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}让怪兽召唤出来{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.99,0:10:22.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}破坏掉　再给玩家
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.81,0:10:25.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}造成伤害的强力 combo。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.10,0:10:27.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}居然　这么厉害啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.13,0:10:29.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}但是，有办法回避。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.50,0:10:31.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}说得也是呢。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.00,0:10:35.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}但是，我会战胜爱！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.41,0:10:37.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我的回合，抽卡！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.28,0:10:39.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}《由于丛林场地，
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.83,0:10:41.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}怪兽必须召唤。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.22,0:10:45.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}如果以攻击表示召唤，你的连招就会发动。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.95,0:10:47.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那么，正确答案是……》
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.14,0:10:51.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}正确答案是以里侧守备表示盖放怪兽！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.90,0:10:55.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}再盖放一张卡，回合结束。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.77,0:10:58.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}怎么样？如果是守备表示，
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.74,0:11:00.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}连招就不会发动了吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.01,0:11:02.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}垂死挣扎也是没用的。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.57,0:11:06.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}从这片丛林里，从我手中，你逃不掉的。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.07,0:11:09.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我的回合，抽卡！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.25,0:11:13.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}在这一瞬间，为了维持
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.10,0:11:13.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}死亡蝴蝶邀请{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.89,0:11:15.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}支付２０００生命值！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.52,0:11:21.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我发动光子蝴蝶刺客的效果！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.25,0:11:25.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}消耗一个超量素材{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.41,0:11:27.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}将场上1只守备表示的怪兽
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.73,0:11:28.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}变成攻击表示！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.61,0:11:34.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}然后 那只怪兽的攻击力
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.60,0:11:35.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}下降600点！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.25,0:11:39.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}纹章兽阿巴科恩威变成攻击表示……
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.55,0:11:42.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}用光子蝴蝶刺客
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.07,0:11:43.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}攻击阿巴科恩威！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.87,0:11:45.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}蝴蝶死亡之舞！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.26,0:12:00.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}然后 由于永续魔法
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.39,0:12:02.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}死亡蝴蝶邀约{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.60,0:12:05.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}被破坏的怪兽的控制者……
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.45,0:12:09.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}受到1500点伤害！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.34,0:12:11.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}太厉害了～ 抽卡！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.29,0:12:15.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我将怪兽以里侧守备表示盖放。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.16,0:12:17.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}回合结束。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.46,0:12:22.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}毫无破绽这就是完美的连招吗。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.11,0:12:25.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我不会让你去快斗那里。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.90,0:12:26.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哎！？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.62,0:12:29.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（托隆）哪怕削减自己的生命值
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.24,0:12:32.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不，甚至连性命都要搭上{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.51,0:12:35.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你也要守护快斗，是吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.08,0:12:37.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你竟然如此
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.35,0:12:39.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}为快斗着想吗。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.14,0:12:43.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这一切也全都是所谓爱的力量吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.09,0:12:45.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哈？　爱
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.99,0:12:48.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}朵罗瓦为了快斗？　什么意思……
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.99,0:12:54.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}真是的，太迟钝了。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.88,0:12:58.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不过　爱的力量啊　总觉得好棒。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.71,0:13:00.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}明白了吗　就算把怪兽
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.64,0:13:02.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}以守备表示召唤出来{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.80,0:13:04.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}也逃不出我的连招。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.19,0:13:09.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我的回合　抽卡。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.40,0:13:14.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我召唤　纹章兽伯纳斯猎鹰。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.73,0:13:17.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}终于下定决心了吗。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.66,0:13:22.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}怪兽以攻击表示被召唤出来的　这一瞬间。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.66,0:13:25.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}永续魔法蝴蝶魅惑的效果发动！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.20,0:13:28.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}对方场上的攻击表示怪兽
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.58,0:13:30.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}必须进行攻击！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.66,0:13:33.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}接着　永续魔法刺客之门的效果发动！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.98,0:13:37.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}除了名字带有刺客的怪兽以外
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.30,0:13:38.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}进行攻击时{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.30,0:13:39.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}强制破坏！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.47,0:13:45.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}然后　由于死亡蝴蝶邀请的
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.39,0:13:46.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}效果…。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.67,0:13:52.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}１５００的伤害。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.54,0:13:53.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}好厉害～！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.16,0:13:55.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}德罗瓦那家伙　说不定真的
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.78,0:13:57.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}能赢托隆啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.44,0:14:01.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}太好了！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.25,0:14:03.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这样一来我的胜利就定…。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.26,0:14:09.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不错。　非常不错。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.82,0:14:11.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}人思念人的爱之力。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.60,0:14:13.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我也想了解呢。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.51,0:14:17.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}充满了快斗回忆的你那痛苦的思念。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.07,0:14:21.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那份记忆就让我啃食殆尽吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.93,0:14:24.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}来吧，上了！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.34,0:14:28.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我发动魔法卡 高级勋章术！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.28,0:14:31.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（托隆）将我墓地中相同等级的
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.59,0:14:33.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}两只纹章兽作为素材{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.18,0:14:34.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}可以进行超量召唤！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.68,0:14:37.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}用墓地的怪兽进行超量召唤！？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.09,0:14:41.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（托隆）我用墓地中等级4的
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.82,0:14:44.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}阿巴科恩威和伯纳斯猎鹰进行叠放！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.99,0:14:46.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}用两只怪兽
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.22,0:14:48.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}构建叠放网络！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.65,0:14:52.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}超量召唤！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.17,0:14:55.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}现身吧，No.8。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.72,0:15:08.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}纹章王 基因组继承者！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.95,0:15:13.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这就是……。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.30,0:15:16.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}托隆的 No.怪兽！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.87,0:15:22.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我就这样回合结束。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.67,0:15:25.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}就算 No.怪兽出来也无所谓。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.55,0:15:26.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}下一回合就决出胜负！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.20,0:15:29.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我的回合，抽卡！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.86,0:15:34.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我绝不会让快斗受到一根手指的伤害！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.38,0:15:38.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}发动光子蝴蝶刺客的效果！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.87,0:15:40.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}使用一个叠放单位{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.32,0:15:44.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}让守备怪兽的攻击力下降６００点
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.13,0:15:45.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}并变成攻击表示！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.26,0:15:48.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}兴奋鳞片！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.98,0:15:52.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}用光子蝴蝶刺客
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.82,0:15:54.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}攻击纹章王基因组继承者！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.39,0:15:56.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这样就结束了！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.71,0:15:58.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}蝴蝶死亡之舞！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.60,0:16:04.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}好，只要这招成功！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.52,0:16:07.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}发动基因组继承者的效果！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.89,0:16:10.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（托隆）使用一个叠放单位，
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.68,0:16:12.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}从三个效果中选择一个！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.41,0:16:17.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我要从你的怪兽那里夺走名字。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.86,0:16:31.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（德罗瓦）什么意思？
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.07,0:16:33.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我把名字夺走了。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.79,0:16:34.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你看看。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.96,0:16:38.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我的基因组·遗传因子的名字
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.93,0:16:41.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}变成了光子蝴蝶刺客。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.33,0:16:46.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（特隆）反过来你的怪兽名字消失了。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.38,0:16:50.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}如果不是刺客的话会怎么样呢
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.38,0:16:54.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}怎 怎么会！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.68,0:16:57.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}来吧 永续魔法刺客之门的
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.25,0:16:59.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}效果发动给你看！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.48,0:17:01.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（特隆）除了名字带有刺客的怪兽以外
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.65,0:17:02.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}的怪兽攻击时{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.13,0:17:05.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}无效那次攻击并破坏！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.45,0:17:07.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}无名氏 给我碎掉吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.66,0:17:11.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我的连招被瓦解了……
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.86,0:17:13.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}furthermore！ 永续魔法
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.68,0:17:16.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}死亡蝴蝶邀请的效果{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.02,0:17:18.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}就让你承受1500点伤害！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.47,0:17:36.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我竟然赢不了那个男人？
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.90,0:17:43.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}对了，我想到个好主意。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.91,0:17:49.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（托隆）把你的记忆也一并夺走。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.21,0:17:54.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不要！！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.80,0:17:59.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}没想到 德罗瓦的记忆竟然……
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.21,0:18:01.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}喂 德罗瓦！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.82,0:18:04.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你怎么了 德罗瓦！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.78,0:18:08.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}怎么能输给托隆那种力量啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.79,0:18:12.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你不是为了快斗才战斗的吗！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.15,0:18:14.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}赢下来……
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.97,0:18:17.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}然后去见快斗啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.39,0:18:20.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我……快斗……
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.91,0:18:22.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}快斗！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.73,0:18:25.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}快斗……
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.11,0:18:26.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}别依赖别人！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.23,0:18:35.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}没错……我不依赖任何人！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.55,0:18:39.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我召唤 月光蝶！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.73,0:18:46.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}再将场上盖放的
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.23,0:18:48.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}幻蝶刺客 大琉璃反转召唤！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.73,0:18:57.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}等级４的 幻蝶刺客 大琉璃和
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.04,0:18:59.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}月光蝶 进行叠放！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.06,0:19:01.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}用２只怪兽
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.15,0:19:03.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}构建叠放网络！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.46,0:19:05.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}超量召唤！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.81,0:19:09.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}现身吧！光子亚历山大蝶后！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.74,0:19:13.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}德鲁瓦…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.47,0:19:15.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我还没放弃！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.72,0:19:19.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}发动光子亚历山大蝶后的效果！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.64,0:19:21.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}将全部超量素材使用{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.80,0:19:24.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}将场上存在的所有怪兽
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.12,0:19:24.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}返回手牌{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.43,0:19:26.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}每有１只该怪兽
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.92,0:19:28.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}就造成５００点伤害{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.71,0:19:30.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}分别给予双方玩家！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.65,0:19:32.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}同归于尽吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.22,0:19:35.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}蝶之效！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.89,0:19:35.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}效果～！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.59,0:19:40.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}生命值… 命 我不需要！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.45,0:19:44.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我带着对快斗的思念 将你…！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.94,0:19:46.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你也太 得寸进尺了！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.08,0:19:49.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你的思念 你的记忆{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.29,0:19:51.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}就由我 美美地吃掉吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.88,0:19:54.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}陷阱发动！ 徽章记录！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.26,0:19:57.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}将使用超量单元的效果
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.68,0:19:58.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}无效化！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.01,0:20:06.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}怎… 怎么会…！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.16,0:20:11.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}回合呢？
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.75,0:20:15.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}回合… 结束。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.08,0:20:18.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}抽卡！ 振作一点～！！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.74,0:20:21.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不要！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.59,0:20:24.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我不想忘记… 你…
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.29,0:20:26.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}流进来了哦。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.10,0:20:29.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你的意识… 记忆… 爱…。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.73,0:20:33.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}库库库库！ 我的回合 抽卡！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.13,0:20:36.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}在我的体内 安息吧 抽卡。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.24,0:20:39.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}用光子蝴蝶刺客{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.20,0:20:41.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}攻击光子亚历山大女王！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.71,0:20:45.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}住手～！！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.29,0:20:47.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}蝴蝶死亡之舞！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.71,0:20:57.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}由于死亡蝴蝶邀请的效果{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.92,0:21:00.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}德鲁瓦 你 将踏上忘却之旅。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.16,0:21:08.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}快斗…。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.89,0:21:11.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}凯…。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.51,0:21:24.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哼！什么嘛～。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.56,0:21:28.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}所谓的爱和记忆一点～都不好吃。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.45,0:21:30.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}托隆！！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.64,0:21:33.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}下一个 就吃掉你的心吧 游马。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.58,0:21:37.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}德鲁瓦！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.50,0:21:44.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}帮我转告那个人…。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.79,0:21:48.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}请…记住我…。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.57,0:21:57.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}快斗…。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.50,0:21:59.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}怎么会…。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.61,0:22:01.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这就是…托隆的力量！
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.11,0:22:06.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}绝对…绝对饶不了你！
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.73,0:22:08.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}托隆！！
Dialogue: 0,0:24:10.72,0:24:11.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这次要介绍的是
Dialogue: 0,0:24:11.81,0:24:14.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}No.8 纹章王 基因组·继承者。
Dialogue: 0,0:24:14.39,0:24:15.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}吸收对手的能力{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:24:16.23,0:24:18.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}并抹消其名字是个可怕的怪兽。
Dialogue: 0,0:24:18.95,0:24:19.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}呃……
Dialogue: 0,0:24:19.76,0:24:21.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}喂喂 你忘了我的名字吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:24:22.29,0:24:23.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}话说 你……是谁来着？

